<%- include('partials/header', { currentPage: 'rules' }) %>

<div class="page">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px">

    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-title">📋 Competition Rules</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">

      <div class="rules-section">
        <h3>🎯 How to Play</h3>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.8">
          Predict the outcome of every FIFA World Cup 2026 match. For each match, select the winning team (or Draw in group stage).
          In knockout rounds, also predict whether the match ends in 90 minutes or goes to AET/Penalties for a bonus point.
          Earn points for correct predictions and compete with your friends on the leaderboard!
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider">

      <div class="rules-section">
        <h3>⚽ Group Stage (72 matches)</h3>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:12px">Choose: <strong>Team A Win</strong> · <strong>Draw</strong> · <strong>Team B Win</strong></p>
        <table class="rules-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Outcome</th><th>Points</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>✅ Correct prediction</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">1 point</strong></td></tr>
            <tr><td>❌ Wrong prediction</td><td>0 points</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Maximum group stage total</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">72 points</strong></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider">

      <div class="rules-section">
        <h3>🏆 Knockout Stage</h3>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:12px">
          Choose the <strong>winning team</strong> (no draws). Also predict: <strong>90 Minutes</strong> or <strong>AET/Penalties</strong> for a bonus point.
          Bonus is only awarded if you also correctly predicted the winner.
        </p>
        <table class="rules-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Round</th>
              <th>Correct Winner</th>
              <th>AET Bonus</th>
              <th>Max per match</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Round of 32</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">2 pts</strong></td><td>+1 pt</td><td>3 pts</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Round of 16</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">3 pts</strong></td><td>+1 pt</td><td>4 pts</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Quarterfinals</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">4 pts</strong></td><td>+1 pt</td><td>5 pts</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Semifinals</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">5 pts</strong></td><td>+1 pt</td><td>6 pts</td></tr>
            <tr><td>3rd Place Match</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">4 pts</strong></td><td>+1 pt</td><td>5 pts</td></tr>
            <tr><td>⭐ Final</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">6 pts</strong></td><td>+1 pt</td><td>7 pts</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider">

      <div class="rules-section">
        <h3>🔒 Prediction Locks</h3>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.8">
          The admin will lock predictions before each match or round begins. Once locked, you cannot change your prediction.
          Make sure to submit early! You can edit your prediction at any time before the lock.
          Locked predictions are final — no exceptions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider">

      <div class="rules-section">
        <h3>🕐 Times</h3>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.8">
          All match times on this platform are displayed in <strong style="color:var(--text)">Kuwait Time (UTC+3)</strong>.
          Make sure to submit predictions before kickoff time shown on each match card.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="divider">

      <div class="rules-section" id="prizes" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <h3>💰 Prize Distribution</h3>
        <p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px">
          Prizes are awarded after the Final match using the <strong style="color:var(--text)">Competition Ranking (1224)</strong> system.
          Tied players share the combined prize money of all positions they occupy, divided equally.
        </p>

        <table class="rules-table" style="margin-bottom:20px">
          <thead><tr><th>Position</th><th>Prize</th><th>Award</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>🥇 1st Place</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">200 KD</strong></td><td>Champion Trophy</td></tr>
            <tr><td>🥈 2nd Place</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">80 KD</strong></td><td>Silver Medal</td></tr>
            <tr><td>🥉 3rd Place</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">50 KD</strong></td><td>Bronze Medal</td></tr>
            <tr><td colspan="2" style="color:var(--text-dim)">Total Prize Pool</td><td><strong style="color:var(--gold)">330 KD</strong></td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p style="font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:10px">How tie-splitting works</p>

        <div style="display:grid;gap:10px;font-size:.82rem">

          <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px">Example 1 — Two players tie for 1st</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.7">
              1st + 2nd positions occupied → prizes combined: 200 + 80 = <strong style="color:var(--gold)">280 KD</strong><br>
              Each receives <strong style="color:var(--gold)">140 KD</strong> · Next player finishes 3rd (50 KD)
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px">Example 2 — Two players tie for 2nd</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.7">
              2nd + 3rd positions occupied → prizes combined: 80 + 50 = <strong style="color:var(--gold)">130 KD</strong><br>
              Each receives <strong style="color:var(--gold)">65 KD</strong> · 1st place unaffected (200 KD)
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px">
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:6px">Example 3 — Three or more players tie for 1st</div>
            <div style="color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.7">
              All prize positions occupied → entire pool: 200 + 80 + 50 = <strong style="color:var(--gold)">330 KD</strong> split equally<br>
              Only Champion Trophies awarded — no separate 2nd or 3rd prizes
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <p style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px;line-height:1.6">
          When prizes don't divide evenly, amounts are rounded to the nearest 1 KD while ensuring the full 330 KD is always distributed.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
